                ```sql
                select count(1)
                  from roman.notasvendas nv
                 where nv.idrepresentante = :P75_IDREPRESENTANTE
                   and nv.idsituacaonotavenda = 4
                   and nv.saldo < -1
                   and (    nv.semanacobranca = :P75_SEMANA
                         or exists ( select 1
                                       from roman.pagamentosnotasvendas pg
                                      where pg.idnotavenda = nv.idnotavenda
                                        and pg.semanacobranca = :P75_SEMANA
                                        and pg.origem = 'R' ) )
                /* 10052435 - Maicon Aimi - 25/03/2025 -- Alinhado com a Jenny que deve ser ignorado esse filtro de classificações
                   and exists ( select 1
                                  from classificacoesnotasvendas cf
                                 where cf.idnotavenda = nv.idnotavenda
                                   and cf.idcaracteristicanotavenda = 47 )*/
                ```
            used: always
